{"data":{"content":"//// The drawing Path types produced by the evaluator and rendered by the\n//// animator.\n////\n//// The canvas maps a 1000-wide box centred on the origin onto its full size, and\n//// x, y, and thickness are all in those units.\n\n/// A point in world coordinates.\npub type Point {\n  Point(x: Float, y: Float)\n}\n\npub type Shape {\n  Line(start: Point, end: Point)\n}\n\npub type Path {\n  // start and end are the times (in tenths of a second) between which the path is\n  // drawn: the reveal runs linearly from nothing at start to the complete shape at\n  // end. A path with end <= start appears complete the moment it starts.\n  Path(shape: Shape, start: Float, end: Float, thickness: Float)\n}\n","line_count":22,"path":"src/shape.gleam","sha256":"de7813ac593728b2f322b3eecafb888bf088b35843b28b5b2b0d18b614de384e"},"hash":"92d0b1c134086b55193426c5766f8b5292eed8bb432e145532f10282ec40d519","kind":"doc.open","prev_hash":"2e08da46c7e4f3ab7841768ef4f3c8514dbdc9047f951e6c5f225d43480a062f","seq":2893,"t":31603038,"wall":"2026-11-12T03:12:08.258Z"}
