{"data":{"path":"extension.txt","range":{"end":{"character":22,"line":17},"start":{"character":0,"line":0}},"was_selection":true},"hash":"ba7f27d786af8d08e4c02f91deae2c01454c4c814fed72412e12c145b7fbb8d2","kind":"selection.change","prev_hash":"949d5df4f43284e55e3e106aa7c6d38d48ec8591f124a84e4cb604f9c18af094","seq":3188,"t":32903852,"wall":"2026-11-12T03:33:49.080Z"}
{"data":{"deltas":[{"range":{"end":{"character":22,"line":17},"start":{"character":0,"line":0}},"text":"Extension Overview: Interactive Path-Following & Particle Collection Game\n\n1. Core Concept & Gameplay Loop\nThis extension transforms the procedural geometric drawings into an interactive path-following and particle-collection game. Instead of passively observing the generated animations, users navigate their cursor along the rendered cyan geometric tracks to collect glowing gold target particles while avoiding stepping off the drawn paths.\n\n2. Technical Implementation Details\n- Unified World-Coordinate Mapping: Cursor events on the canvas are decoded using `offsetX / clientWidth` and `offsetY / clientHeight` normalization and mapped into the engine's native 1000x1000 world coordinate system (-500.0 to +500.0). The gold target overlay uses matching percentage-based CSS transforms inside a responsive wrapper so visual alignment stays locked to the canvas geometry across all viewport sizes.\n- Dynamic Geometry-Aware Target Spawning: The target spawner inspects the active `List(RenderPath)` points, extracts segment endpoints along with quartile interpolated points (25%, 50%, 75%), and deduplicates shared vertices via `list.unique`. Using a seeded hash and a minimum jump-distance filter (> 100 world units), each collected particle relocates to a distinct, reachable location across the entire drawing.\n- Point-to-Segment Collision & Cooldown System: Off-track detection computes the exact perpendicular Euclidean distance from the cursor to every rendered line segment (`point_to_segment_dist`). Straying more than 95 world units off the nearest cyan segment deducts 1 Health Point and triggers a 35-tick invulnerability cooldown to prevent rapid multi-hit drains. Reaching 0 HP triggers a Game Over state with a one-click Restart button.\n\n3. How to Try It\n- Select any drawing preset (such as `string_art`, `square_spiral`, or `tree`) from the dropdown menu, or adjust the shape slider to dynamically regenerate the track layout.\n- Move your cursor onto the cyan lines inside the canvas and follow the paths to touch the glowing gold dot (+50 points per pickup).\n- Stay close to the cyan paths to preserve your 3 Health Points, and click \"Restart\" in the top-right HUD at any time to reset your score and health."}],"path":"extension.txt","source":"paste_likely"},"hash":"b125a964ee9408a756fe26d65211f07ef280463ef1ce6a9ba5c319d7a4807600","kind":"doc.change","prev_hash":"ba7f27d786af8d08e4c02f91deae2c01454c4c814fed72412e12c145b7fbb8d2","seq":3189,"t":32904950,"wall":"2026-11-12T03:33:50.178Z"}
